Title: Constrained Delaunay Triangulation for GNU Octave
Description: Constrained Delaunay triangulation bindings for GNU Octave using the p2t C ABI, with polygon and PSLG point/segment inputs.
Categories: Geometry
Depends: octave (>= 8.0.0)
